gcd(n²+2n+7, n+3) = gcd(n+3, value at n=-3: 9-6+7=10). So we need gcd(n+3, 10) > 1, i.e., n+3 divisible by 2 or 5.

n+3 ranges 4 to 1003. Multiples of 2: 500; multiples of 5: 200; multiples of 10: 100. Union = 500+200−100 = 600.

{"answer": 600, "confidence": 95}

